# sgo.build (schema: see the sgola tree's core/sgo.build). wataui is the
# DECLARATIVE UI layer: a liblink library over core ALONE — no json, no
# wataclient, no `go.*` facade — because every backend that will ever render
# these views (the framebuffer painter today, UIKit later) has to be able to
# link it. A default package, no @goexport: its whole surface is consumed from
# Sgola, whole-program, as a source sibling in this repo.
mode liblink
emitname wataui
optreport
